{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "d9f2f58743e2fc25239e26fc5c1f3da578e5b81974b4dc0c4135f316d2b1286c", "ja": "大丈夫！\nそこは茜ちゃんの天才的なトークで、どうにかするよ！", "zh": "没问题！\n这部分小茜会用高明的话术来想办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
