{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "162488d0fb5bfac5bd3fa802ae24d8d5ea253ab780cc6234b41e5c210c50ba2f", "ja": "茜、ちょっと待って……\nロコ、話を続けてくれないか。", "zh": "茜，你先等一下……\nROCO，可以请你继续把话说完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
