{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "5dafedf0ce46c64bc19b56857d8927cccf7bf19accd174f314da3f01b66d7d7d", "ja": "え、えっと……あ、茜ちゃん！　もしかしたら……\nそういうのは、関係ないカモですっ！", "zh": "呃、那个……小、小茜！\n或许……跟直播成不成功没有关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "33216c888577a72b9897665634e1957a5d1abee65bc394ce2713aa15467836ac", "ja": "ありさ、なんとなくですケド……。\nロコちゃんの気持ち、わかる気がして、ですね……。", "zh": "亚利沙觉得自己……\n好像能明白ROCO的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "32036255e77f36c043e85eca59e8f1cbdccdb87baffafb14100db18e25d8fb67", "ja": "ロコちゃんは、茜ちゃんに頼ってもらえたことが、一番\n大事で……とっても、うれしかったんだと思います。", "zh": "能受到小茜的依赖对ROCO来说是最重要的……\n这件事应该让她非常高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "b5a9148f8d0b72c98e115d60ee9d421e8f3dcb7293de8b50e976618b1279bcff", "ja": "あー！　それやん！\nもう絶対それやん！！", "zh": "啊──！就是这个！\n肯定就是这个了啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "c95c4056731939d28978f2920c12b3c9942200a9d6b20c2b0fcb7fb35668f8b6", "ja": "え！？　奈緒やんまでわかっちゃったの！？", "zh": "什么！？连阿绪绪都知道了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "c55686dc225b75ecdff94f9b4f3854736206f7db05cff8f4cfb7a5988a6ca573", "ja": "うん……なんとなくやけどな。\nロコは茜に頼られたんが、めっちゃ嬉しかったんや。", "zh": "嗯……隐隐约约啦。\n受到茜的依赖可是让ROCO超高兴呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "89e23982e7dfa4e20235b21a58cdd1b6a74e0a85b6ffd87bf8ce49fdfb534692", "ja": "茜の期待に応えたら、めっちゃ喜んでもらえると\n思うて……それではりきってたんやろなぁ。", "zh": "她想说要是回应了茜的期待，茜会很高兴……\n所以才卯足了劲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "8f519453661fbd8898e0dbad5d9d27a8c542c59b81f59f05caac4de6e150a9c0", "ja": "茜ちゃんの、期待に……？", "zh": "回应小茜的期待……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "5f32e00de5918a44b17ba8854c09f3f082c0dca9a97945c886e9b8b20ecfdaca", "ja": "結局、マスコットは間に合わなかったんですケド。\nでも、それでも別にいいんだよって言われて……。", "zh": "虽然最后吉祥物没有赶上就是了。\n不过，你却跟她说没赶上也没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "6fb3df6528902f6ac84565d2f3df1fdd4d565070d5ec0e391d3eded5773ed75b", "ja": "じつは、そんなに期待してもらえてなかったのかなって\n思っちゃったんじゃないかと……。", "zh": "那她可能会觉得，\n其实你并没有很期待她设计出吉祥物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "37caf4945722414827f1aecd899953cb2fb89310082c3f6d8bda3e7a9ecf9e09", "ja": "ち、違うよっ！？　茜ちゃんはただ、\nロコちゃんに無理して欲しくなかっただけだよ！？", "zh": "哪、哪有！？小茜只是不希望\n小ROCO勉强自己而已啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "63c24641286e05b86b42491198328bcf5b089a8d017229e983af6dfb6ae54bf6", "ja": "うん……でも、そうだな。\nロコにとっては、それも悲しかったんだと思う。", "zh": "嗯……不过，这样说吧，\n对ROCO而言，这点应该也很让她难过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "6633689c4c6e021501594d4a1b64bcf3be6ea647efb57693e9032b1467e255b2", "ja": "無理を押してでも、茜に頼られたこと……。\n必要とされたことが、一番うれしかったんだから。", "zh": "因为受到茜的依赖、被茜需要是令她最高兴的事情……\n即使勉强自己也无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1048_023aka", "source_sha256": "a3526f6db038e72c35138bf07bc5e90e30822117091ba4911fdc8d92b18c9c3c", "ja": "……！\nち、違うよ。違うけど……。けど……そっか。", "zh": "……！\n不、不是的，我没有……我没……原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7261d6f8f4a10ef21c638da4b2b5fbf619002c96cebb2a9120b494b03d982ff", "ja": "茜ちゃん……ロコちゃんを、傷つけちゃった……。\nあああっ、どうしよう！？　どうすればいいの！？", "zh": "小茜……伤到小ROCO了……\n啊啊啊！怎么办！？小茜该怎么办才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1050_037nao", "source_sha256": "baa0cc1b5f2224dad0a6e6d562d6b1bcf320da14adc89772b94ad7a3bc491473", "ja": "ロコ、まだ駅までは行ってへんやろ。\n茜、はよ追いかけんと！", "zh": "ROCO应该还没走到车站啦。\n茜，快去追她吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1051_023aka", "source_sha256": "0266e463e18f5eb7414ef307e78fdad5f6829def1f2ecac95008e1a206b14788", "ja": "え……ええっ！？　追いかけるって、でも……\nでもでも、茜ちゃんのせいなんだよ？", "zh": "咦……咦咦！？你说去追她，可是……\n可是可是，是小茜害她难过的耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "00bcb49f3303984b3061865a636e33828a61ce08466d97dfa988c2ecedc0dabd", "ja": "ロコちゃん、茜ちゃんの顔見たくないかも……。\nなのに……。茜ちゃん、行っていいの？", "zh": "小ROCO或许不想看到小茜的脸……\n那这样……小茜还可以去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_1053", "source_sha256": "3e67edff07e8f7186e26d446b69ef7ec3452a767630b6dd43b7483b53db68d90", "ja": "いいの！", "zh": "可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5ca2934dfd18608f68b3f4d8809567f60fbe828047edb0da5b4dc4c54e3279cc", "ja": "いいんだよ。\nロコが喜ばせたかったのは、誰だと思う？", "zh": "当然可以！\n你以为ROCO这么拚是想让谁高兴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "33661f6e96c185ae0192baae369d73dc881a85e69b4af7e2c2ced592c52bc298", "ja": "そうですよ、茜ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんが追いかけないと！", "zh": "对啊，小茜！\n就是要小茜你去追她才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2002_037nao", "source_sha256": "c4b50178a45678c9898fe64cb60dacd93abceb9d555ccc8558c30352c1c7cb24", "ja": "せやで！\nロコのパートナーは誰やった！？", "zh": "嘿呀！\n不然ROCO的搭档还有谁呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "3d8b13c9eae401ecf4fd76e02ff66bec434b264bd4f1b9e86e6da34af255ec6b", "ja": "ロコちゃんのパートナーは……。\nうんっ！　茜ちゃんだよねっ！！！", "zh": "小ROCO的搭档……\n嗯！只有小茜了对吧！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "18435390f8d25320982d11e80ab2b2c70f141cf2960ea9ad2ca87a08007d9e33", "ja": "わかった！　ありがと{$P$}ちゃん、\n亜利沙ちゃん、奈緒やん！　茜ちゃん、行ってくる！", "zh": "小茜知道了！小{$P$}、\n小亚利、阿绪绪，谢谢你们！小茜这就出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_04_2005_p", "source_sha256": "2b6ace7cdb16dc3bdcd1973151ac552c5b19b0cbda8866120efbd9c3c47f2415", "ja": "（少しすれ違ってしまったけど、二人ならきっと大丈夫\nだろう……。でも一応、様子を見に行かないとな）", "zh": "（虽然产生了一点误会，不过她们两人一定\n没问题的……但我还是得跟去看看情况才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
